== GOAL NOW: CircuitPython + stable oreo-cli + release, so the badge is easy to use ==
Decisions (2026-11-11):
- The CLI is named oreo-cli (command: oreo). Stable 1.0.0 is published on GitHub after you test it here, with full docs.
- File transfer moves out of Settings/WiFi into a pre-installed app "Transfer": the badge shows a code, `oreo transfer send` asks for it, then files go over USB.
- Wi-Fi does only internet work (App Store, OTA, GitHub data, weather, time). The Send Files page and upload server are retired.
- Bluetooth is the last feature (#101, #103, #124).
